# Capacitor native projects (ts/ios, ts/android) ARE committed as the canonical
# native projects (decision meditation-pal-hpoh) — we hand-edit Info.plist perm
# strings, the Sign in with Apple capability, the Google URL scheme, signing,
# and icons, which a regenerate would wipe. Their own inner .gitignores exclude
# build artifacts (Pods/, build/, DerivedData, keystores, copied web assets), so
# `cap sync` updates them without churn. Regenerate ONLY with
# `--packagemanager CocoaPods` on iOS (SPM drops the STT plugin) — see
# dev-docs/mobile.md.

